    <briefdescription>
<para>128-bit secret key for SipHash. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For <bold>hash-flooding protection</bold> (e.g. in <computeroutput>std::unordered_map</computeroutput>), initialise with a random value at program startup. For <bold>compile-time identifiers</bold> and <computeroutput>switch</computeroutput>/<computeroutput>case</computeroutput> dispatch, a fixed key is sufficient. </para>
